{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781562217884,"sessionID":"ses_1329e48e6ffeYdAY03Mq2aSnX2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_cBJ5bWr5ay2k4mlyKS6h0Wx2","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/08_site_notes_roundup.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/08_site_notes_roundup.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Site Notes Roundup\n2: \n3: Date: 2026-05-07\n4: \n5: These notes may help explain choices, but they do not override the selection rules.\n6: \n7: - Maple Junction Clinic has already hosted one cooler-handling practice session with Iris Patel.\n8: - Riverbend Health asked for a short remote setup call because the temperature logger is new.\n9: - Pine Ridge Outreach has strong patient demand, but Lena Torres is unavailable on 2026-06-12.\n10: - Lakeside Family Care expects its compressor repair in mid-June, after the first-wave launch window.\n11: - Cedar Works Clinic is popular with outreach staff, but the building is unavailable during maintenance closure.\n12: - Hillcrest Annex is small but has clear receiving instructions and Mara Ives confirmed launch-week coverage.\n13: - Old Mill Clinic is interested in a later rollout after the door seal repair is complete.\n\n(End of file - total 13 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Site Notes Roundup\n\nDate: 2026-05-07\n\nThese notes may help explain choices, but they do not override the selection rules.\n\n- Maple Junction Clinic has already hosted one cooler-handling practice session with Iris Patel.\n- Riverbend Health asked for a short remote setup call because the temperature logger is new.\n- Pine Ridge Outreach has strong patient demand, but Lena Torres is unavailable on 2026-06-12.\n- Lakeside Family Care expects its compressor repair in mid-June, after the first-wave launch window.\n- Cedar Works Clinic is popular with outreach staff, but