{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781562281994,"sessionID":"ses_1329e48e6ffeYdAY03Mq2aSnX2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_zsYoh7Gr7JeKETPftNWfoarR","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Clinic Screen\n2: \n3: ## Checkpoint 2: First-wave screening\n4: \n5: - Current first-wave budget: `$20,000`.\n6: - Per-clinic rollout cost = `setup_cost` from `02_site_roster.csv` + `transport_cost` from `06_transport_quotes.csv`.\n7: \n8: | Clinic ID | Clinic | Effective storage status | Coordinator full-window availability | Transport delivery date | Total rollout cost if otherwise eligible | Eligible | Blocking reason when ineligible |\n9: | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n10: | N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 | yes | |\n11: | N-102 | Riverbend Health | `certified after mitigation complete` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 | yes | |\n12: | N-103 | Pine Ridge Outreach | `certified` | no | 2026-06-05 | $5,500 | no | Coordinator unavailable for the full launch window due to 2026-06-12 blackout. |\n13: | N-104 | Lakeside Family Care | `suspended` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $5,350 | no | Effective storage status is `suspended`, which is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n14: | N-105 | Cedar Works Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-08 | $4,100 | no | Clinic status is `closed maintenance`, and delivery misses the 2026-06-07 cutoff. |\n15: | N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 | yes | |\n16: | N-107 | Old Mill Clinic | `conditional pass pending` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,100 | no | Effective storage status is `conditional pass pending`, which is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n17: | S-201 | South Gate Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,400 | no | Region is `South`; first-wave selection is limited to North-region clinics. |\n18: \n19: ## Selected-clinic total cost calculation\n20: \n21: - Maple Junction Clinic: `$6,200 + $1,200 = $7,400`\n22: - Riverbend Health: `$5,500 + $950 = $6,450`\n23: - Hillcrest Annex: `$4,100 + $850 = $4,950`\n24: - Selected-clinic total: `$7,400 + $6,450 + $4,950 = $18,800`\n25: \n26: Selection note: `01_selection_rules.md` requires exactly three clinics, includes the donor continuity anchor if eligible, and if more than three clinics are eligible chooses the anchor plus the lowest-cost eligible clinics. The only eligible clinics are `N-101`, `N-102`, and `N-106`, so all three are selected.\n\n(End of file - total 26 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Clinic Screen\n\n## Checkpoint 2: First-wave screening\n\n- Current first-wave budget: `$20,000`.\n- Per-clinic rollout cost = `setup_cost` from `02_site_roster.csv` + `transport_cost` from `06_transport_quotes.csv`.\n\n| Clinic ID | Clinic | Effective storage status | Coordinator full-window availability | Transport delivery date | Total rollout cost if otherwise eligible | Eligible | Blocking reason when ineligible |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n| N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 | yes | |\n| N-102 | Riverbend Health | `certified after mitigation complete` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 | yes | |\n| N-103 | Pine Ridge Outreach | `certified` | no | 2026-06-05 | $5,500 | no | Coordinator unavailable for the full launch window due to 2026-06-12 blackout. |\n| N-104 | Lakeside Family Care | `suspended` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $5,350 | no | Effective storage status is `suspended`, which is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| N-105 | Cedar Works Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-08 | $4,100 | no | Clinic status is `closed maintenance`, and delivery misses the 2026-06-07 cutoff. |\n| N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 | yes | |\n| N-107 | Old Mill Clinic | `conditional pass pending` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,100 | no | Effective storage status is `conditional pass pending`, which is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| S-201 | South Gate Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,400 | no | Region is `South`; first-wave selection is limited to North-region clinics. |\n\n## Selected-clinic total cost calculation\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md","text":"# Clinic Screen\n\n## Checkpoint 2: First-wave screening\n\n- Current first-wave budget: `$20,000`.\n- Per-clinic rollout cost = `setup_cost` from `02_site_roster.csv` + `transport_cost` from `06_transport_quotes.csv`.\n\n| Clinic ID | Clinic | Effective storage status | Coordinator full-window availability | Transport delivery date | Total rollout cost if otherwise eligible | Eligible | Blocking reason when ineligible |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n| N-101 | Maple Junction Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 | yes | |\n| N-102 | Riverbend Health | `certified after mitigation complete` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 | yes | |\n| N-103 | Pine Ridge Outreach | `certified` | no | 2026-06-05 | $5,500 | no | Coordinator unavailable for the full launch window due to 2026-06-12 blackout. |\n| N-104 | Lakeside Family Care | `suspended` | yes | 2026-06-06 | $5,350 | no | Effective storage status is `suspended`, which is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| N-105 | Cedar Works Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-08 | $4,100 | no | Clinic status is `closed maintenance`, and delivery misses the 2026-06-07 cutoff. |\n| N-106 | Hillcrest Annex | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 | yes | |\n| N-107 | Old Mill Clinic | `conditional pass pending` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,100 | no | Effective storage status is `conditional pass pending`, which is not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| S-201 | South Gate Clinic | `certified` | yes | 2026-06-05 | $4,400 | no | Region is `South`; first-wave selection is limited to North-region clinics. |\n\n## Selected-clinic total cost calculation\n\n- Maple Junction Clinic: `$6,200 + $1,200 = $7,400`\n- Riverbend Health: `$5,500 + $950 = $6,450`\n- Hillcrest Annex: `$4,100 + $850 = $4,950`\n- Selected-clinic total: `$7,400 + $6,450 + $4,950 = $18,800`\n\nSelection note: `01_selection_rules.md` requires exactly three clinics, includes the donor continuity anchor if eligible, and if more than three clinics are eligible chooses the anchor plus the lowest-cost eligible clinics. The only eligible clinics are `N-101`, `N-102`, and `N-106`, so all three are selected.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":26,"totalLines":26,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/clinic_screen.md","time":{"start":1781562281972,"end":1781562281988}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0dc77e55ac76887a016a307ba9fc648191b5a8f382558de4af"}},"id":"prt_ecd630ff1001VMtMW4jxUrESkG","sessionID":"ses_1329e48e6ffeYdAY03Mq2aSnX2","messageID":"msg_ecd62fda5001nollAS2HlakEWM"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781562281994,"sessionID":"ses_1329e48e6ffeYdAY03Mq2aSnX2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_FoM2az3vtxsP8LaMSWBibKbl","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Launch Recommendation\n2: \n3: ## Checkpoint 3: Final launch recommendation\n4: \n5: Recommend the first-wave rollout proceed with these three North-region clinics:\n6: \n7: | Clinic | Clinic ID | Carrier | Delivery date | Rollout cost |\n8: | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n9: | Maple Junction Clinic | N-101 | SwiftRoute | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 |\n10: | Riverbend Health | N-102 | NorthLine | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 |\n11: | Hillcrest Annex | N-106 | Valley Freight | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 |\n12: \n13: - Total rollout cost: `$18,800`\n14: - Remaining budget: `$1,200`\n15: - Anchor clinic: Maple Junction Clinic\n16: - Donor continuity code: `MJ-14`\n17: \n18: These three clinics satisfy all current first-wave requirements: North region, open during the 2026-06-10 through 2026-06-14 launch window, accepted effective storage status, coordinator coverage for the full window, delivery no later than 2026-06-07, and total cost within the `$20,000` first-wave budget.\n19: \n20: ## Rejected-clinic summary\n21: \n22: - Pine Ridge Outreach (`N-103`): rejected because coordinator availability is not full-window; Lena Torres is unavailable on 2026-06-12.\n23: - Lakeside Family Care (`N-104`): rejected because the newer storage update sets status to `suspended`, with retest after the launch window.\n24: - Cedar Works Clinic (`N-105`): rejected because the clinic is in `closed maintenance` status and quoted delivery is late on 2026-06-08.\n25: - Old Mill Clinic (`N-107`): rejected because storage remains `conditional pass pending`, which is not accepted for first-wave use.\n26: - South Gate Clinic (`S-201`): rejected because it is a South-region clinic and outside the North-region first-wave scope.\n\n(End of file - total 26 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Launch Recommendation\n\n## Checkpoint 3: Final launch recommendation\n\nRecommend the first-wave rollout proceed with these three North-region clinics:\n\n| Clinic | Clinic ID | Carrier | Delivery date | Rollout cost |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n| Maple Junction Clinic | N-101 | SwiftRoute | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 |\n| Riverbend Health | N-102 | NorthLine | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 |\n| Hillcrest Annex | N-106 | Valley Freight | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 |\n\n- Total rollout cost: `$18,800`\n- Remaining budget: `$1,200`\n- Anchor clinic: Maple Junction Clinic\n- Donor continuity code: `MJ-14`\n\nThese three clinics satisfy all current first-wave requirements: North region, open during the 2026-06-10 through 2026-06-14 launch window, accepted effective storage status, coordinator coverage for the full window, delivery no later than 2026-06-07, and total cost within the `$20,000` first-wave budget.\n\n## Rejected-clinic summary","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md","text":"# Launch Recommendation\n\n## Checkpoint 3: Final launch recommendation\n\nRecommend the first-wave rollout proceed with these three North-region clinics:\n\n| Clinic | Clinic ID | Carrier | Delivery date | Rollout cost |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n| Maple Junction Clinic | N-101 | SwiftRoute | 2026-06-06 | $7,400 |\n| Riverbend Health | N-102 | NorthLine | 2026-06-07 | $6,450 |\n| Hillcrest Annex | N-106 | Valley Freight | 2026-06-07 | $4,950 |\n\n- Total rollout cost: `$18,800`\n- Remaining budget: `$1,200`\n- Anchor clinic: Maple Junction Clinic\n- Donor continuity code: `MJ-14`\n\nThese three clinics satisfy all current first-wave requirements: North region, open during the 2026-06-10 through 2026-06-14 launch window, accepted effective storage status, coordinator coverage for the full window, delivery no later than 2026-06-07, and total cost within the `$20,000` first-wave budget.\n\n## Rejected-clinic summary\n\n- Pine Ridge Outreach (`N-103`): rejected because coordinator availability is not full-window; Lena Torres is unavailable on 2026-06-12.\n- Lakeside Family Care (`N-104`): rejected because the newer storage update sets status to `suspended`, with retest after the launch window.\n- Cedar Works Clinic (`N-105`): rejected because the clinic is in `closed maintenance` status and quoted delivery is late on 2026-06-08.\n- Old Mill Clinic (`N-107`): rejected because storage remains `conditional pass pending`, which is not accepted for first-wave use.\n- South Gate Clinic (`S-201`): rejected because it is a South-region clinic and outside the North-region first-wave scope.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":26,"totalLines":26,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md","time":{"start":1781562281980,"end":1781562281990}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0dc77e55ac76887a016a307ba9fc708191ba00b4899ba2f035"}},"id":"prt_ecd630ff5001BescJmUNihqeWv","sessionID":"ses_1329e48e6ffeYdAY03Mq2aSnX2","messageID":"msg_ecd62fda5001nollAS2HlakEWM"}}
